        "name": "Dungeon Explorer",
        "summary": "Dungeon Explorer is an action RPG developed by Westone and Hudson Soft and released for the Sega Mega-CD in 1995.\n\nDespite sharing a name, the Mega-CD Dungeon Explorer is not a port of an earlier Dungeon Explorer, released for the PC Engine in 1989. While related, the Mega-CD game is designed to play more like Atari Games's Gauntlet, and is exclusive to Sega's system.",
