        "name": "Capcom no Quiz: Tonosama no Yabou",
        "summary": "Capcom no Quiz: Tonosama no Yabou is an arcade quiz game framed like a Sengoku strategy sim, and is a port for Quiz Tonosama no Yabou. The player has to answer a certain number of questions correctly to conquer neighboring territory.",
