      {
        "id": 46402,
        "name": "Ranma 1/2: Byakuran Aika",
        "summary": "This is the only Ranma game on this platform and was only released in Japan.\nIt features an original story centering on a new character, Arisa Nanjo. After Ranma Saotome's friends go missing, it is up to him to track them down.\nThe game is a video novel which involves the player, acting as Ranma, selecting from a series of choices, such as what to do or say to someone. The results are then played out in an animated sequence. It uses a Rock-Paper-Scissors-style battle system.\nThe characters are voiced by the original cast from the Anime series.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/bx1b4rkinu9vhw2iwani.jpg",
