        "summary": "Bug Blasters: The Exterminators is an unreleased Sega Mega-CD game developed by Digital Pictures. It was an on-the-rails shoot-'em-up game paired with many full motion video cutscenes, set for release in 1995. It appeared at Summer CES 1994.\n\nThough the game was not officially released, it was completed and a prototype has since emerged. It was unofficially distributed commercially by Good Deal Games in 2001.",
